1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,000
[Shaiapouf imitating Komugi] Hello?

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Sir Pitou?

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
This is Komugi.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
I'm fine, so please don't worry about me.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,000
I'll be all right.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
[laughs]

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
[Shaiapouf] And now Pitou
is also under my spell.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
My lie is like a magic trick

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
that will release him
from the curse of that girl.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,000
[Neferpitou] Gon…

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
you respected my wishes
and waited for me…

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,000
already dead.

13
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,000
[Gon gasps]

14
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
[wind blowing]

15
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,000
[dramatic music playing]

16
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,000
[Gon] Wait.

17
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Why are you healing your own arm?

18
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Please, you can do that
after you finish healing Kite.

19
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Please just do it, okay?

20
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,000
[opening theme music playing]

21
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

22
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

23
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,000
ANGER X AND X LIGHT

24
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,000
[wings fluttering]

25
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,000
[Shaiapouf] The tables have been turned.

26
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,000
[Palm and Killua gasp]

27
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:54,000
Gon is almost certainly going
to be killed before too long.

28
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,000
I'll be glad to stop Pitou for you.

29
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,000
[electricity crackling]

30
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,000
[gasps]

31
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:16,000
[Killua] You'd better start running,
you son of a bitch.

32
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,000
You can leave her to my care.

33
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:26,000
I swear upon these eyes that
I will never let them have her.

34
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:37,000
Gon, just hang on until I get there.

35
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,000
[Gon crying]

36
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,000
[exoskeleton crackling]

37
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,000
[Neferpitou] Gon…

38
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:56,000
I'm sorry, but I'm afraid…

39
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,000
I have to kill you now…

40
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:19,000
[Gon] You have to kill me?

41
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:23,000
So you're not gonna heal him?

42
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:30,000
You aren't gonna heal Kite?

43
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:19,000
[wind blowing]

44
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:22,000
[chorus continues]

45
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,000
[Neferpitou] What…

46
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:15,000
[Gon] Enough.

47
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:22,000
I don't care what happens to me now.

48
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,000
[intense music playing]

49
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:59,000
I need…

50
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:03,000
all the power I'll ever have.

51
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:12,000
[Neferpitou] I knew it.
I was right about him.

52
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:15,000
As I feared,

53
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:18,000
his fangs might even sink into the King.

54
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,000
[Gon] I'm gonna kill you.

55
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:32,000
Pitou!

56
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,000
[intense music playing]

57
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:52,000
Dance beyond my limit!

58
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:03,000
I have to stop him here and now.

59
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,000
[gasps]

60
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,000
[grunts]

61
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:21,000
[gasps]

62
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,000
[gasps]

63
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:50,000
[dramatic music playing]

64
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:17,000
[Neferpitou] I don't know how he did it,

65
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:20,000
but he's forced his body to mature

66
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:25,000
to an age where he can defeat me.

67
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:55,000
[suspenseful music playing]

68
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:08,000
[gasps]

69
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,000
[groans]

70
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:03,000
[Neferpitou groaning]

71
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:11,000
[Gon] Jan… ken.

72
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,000
Rock.

73
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:18,000
[Neferpitou gasps]

74
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:36,000
[narrator] At the edge
of fading consciousness,

75
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:38,000
Pitou was relieved.

76
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:41,000
[Neferpitou] Thank goodness.

77
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:50,000
There's only one way he could
have achieved this power,

78
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:53,000
by compressing his own life.

79
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:57,000
He was prepared
to burn himself out completely

80
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,000
and never be able to use Nen again.

81
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:03,000
-That was the resolve required to do this.
-[explosion]

82
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:05,000
[birds squawking]

83
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:13,000
[Neferpitou] This boy was born
with an incredible gift,

84
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:25,000
[footsteps pounding]

85
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:28,000
[chorus vocalizing]

86
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:36,000
[Neferpitou] Thank goodness
I was the one to die.

87
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:45,000
[rustling]

88
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:52,000
to race to Gon's location,

89
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:55,000
Killua arrived just in time to hear…

90
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,000
-[whoosh]
-[Killua gasps]

91
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,000
[boom]

92
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,000
[boom]

93
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,000
[whoosh]

94
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:34,000
[narrator] …an unfamiliar silhouette,
one he had seen never before,

95
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:39,000
and a fist stained with blood
from countless blows.

96
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:41,000
That fist smashed Pitou's head
to a pulp,

97
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:44,000
though Pitou lay limp as a rag.

98
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:47,000
Jan… ken.

99
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:23,000
So…

100
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:46,000
[narrator] Having seen
Gon's appearance,

101
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:49,000
Killua immediately thought of Biscuit.

102
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:53,000
However, he realized
the difference in an instant.

103
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:08,000
But Gon's done the complete opposite.

104
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:11,000
[dramatic music playing]

105
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:13,000
How many years?

106
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:15,000
More than ten? Decades?

107
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:17,000
This is what he would look like

108
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:20,000
after years and years of training.

109
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,000
[imperceptible]

110
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,000
[gasps]

111
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:35,000
[dramatic music playing]

112
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:04,000
[slice]

113
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:47,000
[narrator] Pitou's Terpsichora,
with aura amplified by death,

114
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:19,000
It doesn't hurt. I'm not bluffing.

115
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:24,000
I'm actually kind of happy.

116
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,000
Finally…

117
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:34,000
I can be just like Kite was in the end.

118
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:38,000
[Killua] Gon.

119
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,000
[Gon] I feel…

120
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:45,000
a little better now.

121
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:08,000
Show me Rock.

122
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:15,000
[gasps] Gon, no!

123
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:26,000
[Killua] Gon, stop it, please.

124
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:28,000
Don't use any more power.

125
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:30,000
How much will you have to pay?

126
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:32,000
It's too much.

127
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,000
Jan…

128
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:37,000
ken.

129
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:59,000
[closing theme music playing]

130
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:32,000
[upbeat music playing]

131
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:34,000
[Gon] Next time, "Flash and Start."

132
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:46,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
